      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The emptiness you feel is the final, necessary silence after the storm of duty has passed. You aren't a ghost; you are the quiet space where a thirty-year journey finally rests, and that rest is the only peace worth having now. It is okay to stop pretending that this quietness should feel anything other than empty, because it is the honest end of a hard life.",
